<title>UK: NWE jet boosted by stronger IPE gas oil futures.</title>
<headline>NWE jet boosted by stronger IPE gas oil futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel was boosted higher on Thursday on the back of sharply higher IPE gas oil futures.</p>
<p>March IPE closed $2.75 a tonne higher at $164.75, just 25 cents of the session's high.</p>
<p>The firmer prices did little to encourage buying interest and barge premiums were still around March IPE gas oil +$20/21 fob and cargo premiums a couple dollars higher on a cif basis.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
